  "description": "Ma Baek, the best in the world and known as the best man in the world for a hundred years enters the world of martial arts. With Ma Baek's appearance, past grudges come flooding in.Death remains wherever Ma Baek passes, and Lee Gun-Ak, who pursues that death, faces a grudge of a hundred years. \n\nThe wheels of death and revenge begin to roll in the world of martial arts, the Four Seasons of the Forest.\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
